#: ../Doc/library/functools.rst:293
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The class must define one of :meth:`~object.__lt__`, :meth:`~object."
"__le__`, :meth:`~object.__gt__`, or :meth:`~object.__ge__`. In addition, the "
